 "library": {
  "title": "Commando sergeant 2 m",
  "description": "A big, muscular soldier for games, made from the SWAT soldier 1.8 m (Quaternius CC0 low-poly body). Scaled to about 2.0 m tall and ~20 % broader and deeper (scale 1.22 x 1.2 x 1.12 node \"Bigger and broader\"), with sculpt inflate strokes (mirrored in x) bulking the shoulders, upper arms, forearms, upper back, neck and thighs. Olive-drab uniform (#4E5B34). Stripped of the plate carrier, magazine pouches, admin pouch, MOLLE webbing, radio, grenade and hydration backpack, so the body shows; the black visor is hidden and modelled eyes (whites, green irises, pupils, emissive sparkle) sit on the face. Keeps the duty belt and holstered pistol, knee and elbow pads, shoulder patches and the helmet with NVG mount, rails and headset. Stands on z = 0, facing -Y. Static (no skeleton); the animated original is \"SWAT soldier (animated) 1.8 m\".",
  "tags": [
   "soldier",
   "military",
   "army",
